  "question": {
    "text": "A particle slides down on a smooth incline of inclination <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> , fixed in an elevator going up with an acceleration <math><mn>2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></math> The box of incline has width 4m. The time taken by the particle to reach the bottom will be<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0176_d4a61022a436.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 163px; width: 130px;\" />"
  },
